<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the first</p>
<p>day of Sheffield Shield matches on Friday:</p>
<p>In Melbourne: Victoria 270-5 (Dean Jones 121 not out, Ian</p>
<p>Harvey 70) v South Australia</p>
<p>In Sydney: New South Wales 274-7 (Steve Waugh 106, Mark</p>
<p>Taylor 53) v Queensland</p>
<p>In Perth: Tasmania 122-1 (Jamie Cox 62, Dene Hills 48 not</p>
<p>out) v Western Australia.</p>
</text>
